      "source": [
        "# IBM HR Analytics \u2013 Employee Attrition Analysis\n",
        "Explore attrition patterns across 1,470 employee records and 35 project columns."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "import pandas as pd\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport seaborn as sns\n\ndf=pd.read_csv('../data/ibm_hr_analytics.csv')\nprint(df.shape)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "for col in ['Department','JobRole','OverTime']:\n    print('\\n',col)\n    print(df.groupby(col)['Attrition'].apply(lambda x:(x=='Yes').mean()*100).sort_values(ascending=False))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "sns.heatmap(df[['Age','MonthlyIncome','JobSatisfaction','EnvironmentSatisfaction','YearsAtCompany','TotalWorkingYears']].corr(),annot=True)\nplt.title('Correlation Heatmap'); plt.tight_layout()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "sns.countplot(data=df,x='OverTime',hue='Attrition'); plt.title('Attrition by Overtime'); plt.tight_layout()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Business conclusion\n",
        "Overtime employees show elevated attrition risk. Human Resources is a priority department in this portfolio analysis; satisfaction and tenure provide additional segmentation variables for retention planning."
      ]
    }
